# LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# This overrides whatever core.autocrlf each clone happens to have (GitHub
# Desktop sets it to true on Windows), so the library reads the same on
# Windows, on Linux and in Codespaces, and a contributor's first PR does not
# arrive with every file rewritten.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.bin binary
*.gz  binary
*.xz  binary
*.zip binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
